# reel's web demo: Wikimedia Commons playing Satie's first Gymnopédie (recorded by Musopen, musopen.org: public domain,
# credit asked), driven in Chromium over DevTools and narrated by the same two voices as the Musicbox demo.
# `mise run demos commons` records it. A web reel needs no Accessibility and leaves the mouse and keyboard alone.
# Chromium here (any of Chrome, Brave or Edge); WebKit, the default, paints little while reel, a command line tool,
# is not the active app.
Import //demos/reel.reelpreset
Open https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Erik_Satie_-_gymnopedies_-_la_1_ere._lent_et_douloureux.ogg

Output //docs/media/commons.mp4
Output //docs/media/commons.gif
Set Browser chromium
# What fits under a browser's title bar on a 1080 point high screen.
Set Viewport 1280x720
Set Voice guest voicebox:Michael
# A soft piano piece: ducked less than the preset's 30%, so it carries on under the voices.
Set Ducking 60%
# reel's own stings open and close it, as they do the Musicbox demo; the square cut gets title cards.
Intro@crossfade,ease-out,600ms square ? "reel" "Web pages too" : 2s
Outro@fade,800ms square ? "Recorded with reel" "brew install --cask mpdreamz/tap/reel" : 2s

Wait css:".mw-tmh-play"
Say "Reel records web pages too, sound and all."
Zoom cursor 2.2x
# The first click swaps in the player, built under the cursor before the click ends, which leaves it paused; the
# second plays it. The piece's first seconds are near silent, so they are cut.
Click css:".mw-tmh-play-icon"
Wait css:".vjs-play-control"
Sleep 800ms
Click css:".vjs-paused .vjs-play-control"
Wait css:".vjs-playing"
Hide
Sleep 4s
Show
Say@guest "This is Wikimedia Commons, and Erik Satie's first Gymnopédie."
Zoom off
Sleep 2s
Say "It drives Chrome, Brave, Edge or Safari's WebKit, needs no Accessibility, and your mouse stays yours."
Scroll down 4
Zoom css:"#fileinfotpl_perm" 1.8x
Say@guest "And it's in the public domain: free for a demo like this one."
Zoom off
Sleep 2s
Say@over "Search for [search] more Satie,"
Wait [search]
Click css:"#searchInput"
Type@70ms "Erik Satie"
Key return
Say@guest "and that's a take."
Sleep 1s
